# An allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what the image needs is let back in.
# A denylist misses the file nobody thought of — a .env, a coverage database, a
# developer's virtual environment — and copies it into an image that gets shared.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!app/
!migrations/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
